WEBVTT

00:00:01.280 --> 00:00:03.440
My passionate Idol Activities,

00:00:03.440 --> 00:00:06.570
Aikatsu! is about to start!

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:11.300
My name is Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:00:11.300 --> 00:00:13.860
I'm your ordinary first-year middle school student!

00:00:13.860 --> 00:00:15.780
...or so I was supposed to be,

00:00:15.780 --> 00:00:20.380
but after seeing the top idol Kanzaki Mizuki-chan's concert and falling head over heels for her,

00:00:20.380 --> 00:00:24.680
I took the entrance exam for the idol preparation school, Starlight Academy, and ended up passing.

00:00:24.680 --> 00:00:26.660
My Aikatsu finally started.

00:00:27.670 --> 00:00:30.020
Aikatsu stands for idol activities.

00:00:30.020 --> 00:00:34.180
We use the Aikatsu cards to choose our own outfits and stages.

00:00:34.180 --> 00:00:36.930
I'm still new to this idol business,

00:00:36.930 --> 00:00:38.680
but somehow I already have a fan!

00:00:39.320 --> 00:00:43.300
Hoshimiya Ichigo-chan from Starlight Academy?

00:00:43.940 --> 00:00:46.880
As idols, we get our strength from people cheering us on,

00:00:46.880 --> 00:00:50.940
and in return, we lift the spirits of people all over the world.

00:01:07.900 --> 00:01:09.330
Hi, signalize!

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:14.670
The answer lies on the other side of the sky

00:01:09.450 --> 00:01:14.670
kotae wa motto takai sora no kanata

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:16.560
No, that's wrong

00:01:14.930 --> 00:01:16.560
iie chigau yo

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:21.940
I can see with my eyes that it's at the end of the Earth

00:01:16.890 --> 00:01:21.940
boku no me ni mo mieta chi no hate

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:23.730
Do that signalize!

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:28.910
Something's starting to bubble up

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:28.910
hageshiku natta mune no atsui powaa

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.870
From the burning power in my raging heart

00:01:29.200 --> 00:01:32.870
sou da minagiru nanika ga

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:36.410
So I'll believe in the present

00:01:33.160 --> 00:01:36.410
dakara ima wo shinjite

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:41.580
And start today since it's more than a faint desire

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:41.580
hajimeyou tada no akogare ja nai

00:01:41.630 --> 00:01:42.920
Chance for me

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:48.220
Dreams can make even the harshest nightmare pleasant

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:48.220
zankoku na yume ga yume de yume ni narunda

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:52.430
It's just another challenge on the way

00:01:48.220 --> 00:01:52.430
hora chousen matteru yo

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:57.350
Where are we headed?

00:01:53.140 --> 00:01:57.350
kimi to mukau basho wa doko darou

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:01.100
Into a brilliant hope

00:01:57.980 --> 00:02:01.100
mabushii kibou no nake e

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:08.360
Where do we want to go? Let's go find it right now

00:02:01.690 --> 00:02:08.360
nozomu basho wa doko darou sagashi ni ikou yo shuppatsu da

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:11.740
Where we're headed

00:02:08.780 --> 00:02:11.740
mukau basho wa mirai no

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:15.620
is into our hopes for the future

00:02:12.530 --> 00:02:15.620
bokura no kibou no naka ni

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:22.960
Our destination is the future, the light is our signal Let's go, go!

00:02:15.950 --> 00:02:22.960
nozomu basho wa mirai no kagayaki ga aizu let's go, go

00:02:34.820 --> 00:02:36.550
Dash, dash, dash!

00:02:36.550 --> 00:02:38.740
Idols can never be late!

00:02:38.740 --> 00:02:43.980
Yeah! And love is forbidden, you mustn't go to the bathroom, and you have to go to sleep holding a teddy bear!

00:02:43.980 --> 00:02:44.700
Right?

00:02:44.700 --> 00:02:47.560
What decade do you think it is?

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:50.780
{Ah! }I forgot my student ID!

00:02:50.780 --> 00:02:51.300
Huh?

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:52.560
Go on ahead!

00:02:54.500 --> 00:02:55.570
Aoi?

00:02:55.570 --> 00:02:56.940
I'll come along.

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:59.070
Thanks!

00:03:03.980 --> 00:03:06.080
Thanks for coming with me.

00:03:06.080 --> 00:03:09.020
Don't worry about it. 
We're always together, right?

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:13.960
That girl's from our class...

00:03:13.960 --> 00:03:19.220
Shibuki Ran. Thirteen years old, and a veteran idol who's been performing since she was born.

00:03:19.760 --> 00:03:23.460
Despite her age, she's constantly polished her beauty

00:03:23.460 --> 00:03:26.120
and challenged the myth that child actors can't be pretty

00:03:26.120 --> 00:03:30.490
by appearing in all sorts of magazines and fashion shows as a model.

00:03:30.490 --> 00:03:31.960
She's a star of the rising generation.

00:03:31.960 --> 00:03:33.230
Oh, I've heard of her!

00:03:33.560 --> 00:03:37.820
And the nickname she's earned for her sexy image is the "Beautiful Blade".

00:03:38.180 --> 00:03:40.920
I love how it seems like you'd be cut if you touched her!

00:03:40.920 --> 00:03:45.280
Oh yeah, it's strange how I haven't talked to her even though we're in the same class. Alright!

00:03:45.280 --> 00:03:46.330
Hey, Ichigo!

00:03:46.330 --> 00:03:49.080
Good morning, Ran-san.

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:54.920
We're in the same class, but we haven't had the chance to talk yet. Let me introduce myself again.

00:03:54.920 --> 00:03:56.940
I'm Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:03:56.940 --> 00:03:58.860
And she's Kiriya Aoi.

00:03:58.860 --> 00:04:03.570
I'm Kiriya. We're both transfer students, so we're a bit late in our studies.

00:04:03.570 --> 00:04:05.850
As our senior, please teach us what you can.

00:04:07.020 --> 00:04:09.140
Be careful not to disappear together.

00:04:14.600 --> 00:04:16.760
She's sexy <i>and</i> cool!

00:04:16.760 --> 00:04:17.680
Y-Yeah...

00:04:17.680 --> 00:04:20.660
It's so cool how it feels like she'll cut me straight down!

00:04:20.660 --> 00:04:21.120
Sure...

00:04:22.480 --> 00:04:25.160
She kind of feels like Mizuki-chan.

00:04:25.740 --> 00:04:28.400
<i>You understood from today's audition, right?</i>

00:04:28.400 --> 00:04:31.460
<i>No matter how good friends you are,</i>

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:34.120
<i>you won't be able to rise together.</i>

00:04:39.740 --> 00:04:41.500
But still, Ran-san...

00:04:41.500 --> 00:04:44.140
I was finally able to match that move to the song's climax!

00:04:44.140 --> 00:04:45.260
I'm so hungry...

00:04:44.860 --> 00:04:46.500
Just from watching her,

00:04:49.900 --> 00:04:52.580
I get the feeling that she's always alone.

00:04:52.580 --> 00:04:53.270
Yeah.

00:04:53.780 --> 00:04:55.770
The lone wolf look really suits her!

00:04:55.770 --> 00:04:59.260
But it must be hard to carry the jumping blocks alone...

00:04:59.260 --> 00:05:00.900
I'm gonna go help her.

00:05:00.900 --> 00:05:02.380
You probably shouldn't.

00:05:03.820 --> 00:05:07.030
We're still not at the level where it's okay for us to get close to Ran-san.

00:05:07.030 --> 00:05:09.100
And she might actually prefer being alone.

00:05:09.100 --> 00:05:09.760
I see...

00:05:14.740 --> 00:05:16.870
Is there something on my face?

00:05:16.870 --> 00:05:18.220
N-No!

00:05:18.220 --> 00:05:19.250
N-Nothing!

00:05:25.760 --> 00:05:31.350
Galaxy! Amazing! It's showtime! {why the fuck would I full caps that?}

00:05:31.780 --> 00:05:34.580
Johnny-sensei's entrances are always so unique.

00:05:34.580 --> 00:05:35.360
Yeah...

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:38.200
He even calls homeroom "showtime".

00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.940
I'm sure he thinks his entire life is "showtime".

00:05:40.940 --> 00:05:44.070
Honeys, today I somehow...

00:05:44.400 --> 00:05:44.940
<i>somehow,</i>

00:05:45.350 --> 00:05:46.450
SOMEHOW!

00:05:50.360 --> 00:05:53.200
Managed to bring you a chance to go for a fashion show audition!

00:05:55.200 --> 00:05:56.960
Good job, me.

00:05:56.960 --> 00:05:59.000
A fashion show audition?

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:02.500
I can't believe a chance to walk the runway would come so soon.

00:06:02.500 --> 00:06:03.460
Runway?

00:06:04.020 --> 00:06:06.720
You know, that long walkway running through the audience.

00:06:06.720 --> 00:06:08.260
Oh, that!

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:12.510
Anyway, it's amazing to even be able to take the audition for a fashion show.

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:14.960
And on top of that, on top of that, <i>on top of that!</i>

00:06:15.720 --> 00:06:17.980
Those who pass the audition will somehow...

00:06:17.980 --> 00:06:23.360
...be able to model in the popular fashion magazine "Smile Pop Lemon"!

00:06:23.360 --> 00:06:24.080
Yeah!

00:06:26.420 --> 00:06:26.860
Wow!

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:27.740
Amazing!

00:06:27.740 --> 00:06:30.240
However, however, however.

00:06:30.240 --> 00:06:33.880
Only two people from this class can enter the audition.

00:06:33.880 --> 00:06:35.760
There are limited spots, honeys.

00:06:37.400 --> 00:06:42.900
I want those two girls to carry their classmates' dreams with them as they take the audition.

00:06:42.900 --> 00:06:47.500
And by the way, this is a team audition with groups of two.

00:06:47.500 --> 00:06:49.880
The combination is vital.

00:06:50.420 --> 00:06:52.430
Then let's move on and decide the participants.

00:06:52.430 --> 00:06:54.340
I wonder how they'll be decided.

00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:56.140
Maybe a stage walking test?

00:06:56.140 --> 00:06:58.140
The method will be...

00:07:00.390 --> 00:07:01.690
Lottery?!

00:07:01.690 --> 00:07:05.700
It's perfectly fair, as expected of a philanthropist like me!

00:07:05.700 --> 00:07:09.150
Now, draw, draw! Draw your hearts out!

00:07:10.280 --> 00:07:12.080
I hope we can take the audition together.

00:07:12.080 --> 00:07:14.200
Our goal is to pass it together!

00:07:15.240 --> 00:07:18.180
And in the end, the two who won the lottery were...

00:07:23.060 --> 00:07:24.920
Ran-san and me?!

00:07:24.920 --> 00:07:29.980
I'm sure Ran-chan will be fine, but I wonder if Ichigo-chan will be alright since she's so new.

00:07:29.980 --> 00:07:32.940
Ran'll probably get mad if she holds her back.

00:07:37.700 --> 00:07:39.800
I can't believe it's Ran-san out of all people!

00:07:39.800 --> 00:07:40.940
Hang in there, Ichigo.

00:07:41.300 --> 00:07:46.730
For an idol to rise to the top, it's important to have good fortune as well.

00:07:47.070 --> 00:07:49.580
You'll even get to be a magazine model if you pass.

00:07:49.580 --> 00:07:54.080
But Aoi, weren't you just relieved that you wouldn't be paired with Ran-san?

00:07:56.060 --> 00:07:59.580
Your character changed! That laugh isn't my Aoi!

00:08:05.320 --> 00:08:08.500
Ran-san won't even look at me!

00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:10.720
What should I do?!

00:08:10.720 --> 00:08:13.880
If I fall over... no, even if I don't fall,

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:17.100
if we fail the audition, it'll be my fault, right?

00:08:17.100 --> 00:08:19.720
Ran-san will definitely get angry.

00:08:21.700 --> 00:08:23.000
This isn't like you.

00:08:23.000 --> 00:08:23.600
Huh?

00:08:23.600 --> 00:08:28.360
The usual you would be running off before getting caught up in her thoughts.

00:08:29.060 --> 00:08:31.480
That's the Ichigo that I love.

00:08:32.070 --> 00:08:35.260
Be sure to put in my share of the work for the audition.

00:08:38.020 --> 00:08:39.360
Right!

00:08:39.360 --> 00:08:43.580
<i>That right. I have to put in enough effort for Aoi since she couldn't enter the audition.</i>

00:08:43.930 --> 00:08:54.590
Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu! Ai-katsu!

00:08:54.590 --> 00:08:56.930
Raise your chin and straighten your back!

00:08:56.930 --> 00:08:58.000
Yes!

00:09:00.740 --> 00:09:04.310
It says you should try walking while balancing a book on your head.

00:09:04.700 --> 00:09:05.810
I'll try it!

00:09:05.810 --> 00:09:11.820
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:13.180 --> 00:09:15.320
I guess more than ten books was impossible.

00:09:15.320 --> 00:09:18.560
Aikatsu! Aikatsu! Aikatsu!

00:09:20.440 --> 00:09:23.120
You've really gotten more like a real model.

00:09:23.120 --> 00:09:24.680
But I'm still not confident...

00:09:24.680 --> 00:09:26.740
Then we'll run you into the ground tomorrow!

00:09:26.740 --> 00:09:28.080
I'm counting on you!

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:50.940
We'll definitely pass the audition together.

00:09:50.940 --> 00:09:52.200
Yeah.

00:09:52.900 --> 00:09:55.460
I can do my best because you're there for me.

00:09:58.520 --> 00:10:01.040
Trying your best doesn't ensure passing.

00:10:01.040 --> 00:10:03.140
Not to mention doing it together...

00:10:04.060 --> 00:10:05.840
Well, can't change the past.

00:10:20.760 --> 00:10:23.560
And now, it's the day before the audition.

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:25.340
Look at me, Aoi.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:32.060
Aikatsu, Aikatsu, Aikatsu...

00:10:32.310 --> 00:10:33.940
That's great, Ichigo!

00:10:33.940 --> 00:10:36.280
You've gotten really good at walking gracefully.

00:10:36.940 --> 00:10:38.600
It's all thanks to you.

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.070
I couldn't've come this far without you.

00:10:41.070 --> 00:10:44.940
It's because I'm your number one fan and supporter, after all.

00:10:44.940 --> 00:10:46.980
And our catchphrase is...

00:10:46.980 --> 00:10:48.000
Aikatsu!

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:52.460
I'm gonna go walk around the dorms a bit more.

00:10:55.180 --> 00:10:57.210
I can't get left behind!

00:10:57.210 --> 00:11:00.220
Aikatsu, Aikatsu, Aikatsu...

00:11:01.720 --> 00:11:03.080
Mizuki-san!

00:11:03.080 --> 00:11:05.800
I heard that you got a chance to appear in a fashion show audition.

00:11:05.800 --> 00:11:06.720
Y-Yes.

00:11:06.720 --> 00:11:10.420
Make sure to enjoy yourself while walking the runway.

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:14.000
If you're nervous, your smile and outfit won't shine as brightly.

00:11:15.200 --> 00:11:17.480
Thank you for the advice.

00:11:19.500 --> 00:11:20.420
See you.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:24.120
Oh right, watch Ran closely.

00:11:24.460 --> 00:11:27.620
She'll be sure to step with her left foot first on the runway.

00:11:27.620 --> 00:11:29.120
Huh?

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:34.630
Suddenly, it's audition day.

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:39.380
Aikatsu, Aikatsu...

00:11:43.640 --> 00:11:45.500
L-Let's give it our all together!

00:11:46.320 --> 00:11:47.010
Yeah.

00:11:47.010 --> 00:11:52.520
I'm doing to do everything I can on the runway to reach my dream of becoming an idol.

00:11:52.520 --> 00:11:55.920
Hey, do you know what "runway" means?

00:11:55.920 --> 00:11:57.520
Huh? Um...

00:11:57.520 --> 00:12:00.700
Runway. English for "take-off strip".

00:12:00.700 --> 00:12:03.320
The road that all sorts of airplanes fly from.

00:12:03.320 --> 00:12:04.530
Hoshimiya Ichigo.

00:12:04.840 --> 00:12:07.020
It isn't a road for just <i>you</i> to fly from.

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:07.790
What?

00:12:07.790 --> 00:12:12.560
I'm saying that those who only think about themselves have no right to walk along that road.

00:12:13.740 --> 00:12:15.420
<i>Wh-What does she mean?</i>

00:12:15.420 --> 00:12:19.080
<i>Is it wrong to try and grant my own dream?</i>

00:12:19.080 --> 00:12:21.050
<i>Then what should I...?</i>

00:12:25.050 --> 00:12:32.430
Aikatsu, Aikatsu, Aikatsu...

00:12:32.430 --> 00:12:34.220
You still don't understand.

00:12:34.220 --> 00:12:36.060
I figured that I needed to try harder...

00:12:36.380 --> 00:12:41.500
It's a team audition, and I don't want to hold you back.

00:12:41.500 --> 00:12:44.070
The runway isn't a road for you alone.

00:12:44.070 --> 00:12:45.070
Eh?

00:12:45.070 --> 00:12:46.560
Come with me.

00:12:53.210 --> 00:12:57.500
A model's job isn't to look pretty and walk the runway.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:01.710
Our outfit designers, the system engineers, the planners,

00:13:02.140 --> 00:13:05.080
directors, producers...

00:13:05.080 --> 00:13:09.600
It's the model's job to make the stage that all these people put their hearts and souls into shine as brightly as possible.

00:13:10.800 --> 00:13:12.850
There are also the people who come to see her.

00:13:13.600 --> 00:13:19.400
She must embody their feelings of wanting to wear these clothes and go out on a trip somewhere.

00:13:19.400 --> 00:13:21.860
That's our job as models.

00:13:21.860 --> 00:13:26.880
The runway is a place for us to express those various feelings.

00:13:26.880 --> 00:13:29.370
Not a place for us models to take off.

00:13:30.800 --> 00:13:32.370
<i>Ran-san is right.</i>

00:13:32.730 --> 00:13:35.370
<i>There are so many people here.</i>

00:13:35.370 --> 00:13:38.640
<i>I'm not the only one giving her all</i>.

00:13:38.640 --> 00:13:43.480
<i>But despite that, up until just now I've wanted to pass the audition,</i>

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:45.880
<i>and not hold Ran-san back.</i>

00:13:45.880 --> 00:13:49.040
<i>I've only been thinking of myself.</i>

00:13:49.040 --> 00:13:52.390
<i>Come to think of it, Johnny-sensei said so too.</i>

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:58.150
I want those two girls to carry their classmates' dreams with them as they take the audition.

00:13:58.480 --> 00:14:02.640
The runway is a road you walk down, carrying the feelings of lots of people.

00:14:02.640 --> 00:14:06.640
That's what I said. You need to smile for all those people.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:08.400
Not just for yourself.

00:17:33.580 --> 00:17:35.150
That was great, Ichigo.

00:17:35.150 --> 00:17:36.920
You were really lively out there.

00:17:36.920 --> 00:17:39.900
When I was walking, I was saying "thank you" in my heart.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:44.800
I could see everyone: you, all the staff,

00:17:44.800 --> 00:17:47.360
and even the people watching from far away.

00:17:49.000 --> 00:17:51.380
Your face just now was the real deal.

00:17:51.380 --> 00:17:52.420
Huh?

00:17:52.420 --> 00:17:54.120
The face of a real model.

00:17:54.120 --> 00:17:55.240
Really?

00:17:55.920 --> 00:17:58.040
Just for a moment. Like, a tenth of a second.

00:17:58.040 --> 00:17:59.180
Ehh?

00:18:07.140 --> 00:18:09.940
Now then, the long-awaited results are in.

00:18:13.580 --> 00:18:15.840
Congratulations. You passed.

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.320
Thank you very much.

00:18:22.020 --> 00:18:24.140
That was a wonderful stage walk.

00:18:24.140 --> 00:18:27.580
Even though your steps weren't aligned, your breathing was perfectly synched.

00:18:28.120 --> 00:18:30.210
Did you two practice a lot together?

00:18:31.180 --> 00:18:32.210
No.

00:18:32.210 --> 00:18:36.210
Really. I was sure that you must've trained together the whole time...

00:18:36.210 --> 00:18:37.980
We didn't.

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:39.740
Hoshimiya's certainly a prodigy.

00:18:40.340 --> 00:18:41.860
By which I mean airhead.

00:18:41.860 --> 00:18:42.720
Aw...

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:44.720
But she definitely has something.

00:18:44.720 --> 00:18:46.320
That's what I think.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:52.780
I'm surprised! This is the first time I've seen Shibuki praise someone.

00:18:52.780 --> 00:18:55.540
And the first time I've seen you smile outside of when you had to for a job.

00:18:56.680 --> 00:18:58.240
Looks like you've gotten over it.

00:18:58.240 --> 00:18:59.740
That might be true.

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:04.910
Ran-san.

00:19:05.460 --> 00:19:06.240
What?

00:19:06.240 --> 00:19:08.740
Umm... what exactly did you get over?

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.020
I had one too.

00:19:12.020 --> 00:19:15.780
She was my roommate, like Kiriya Aoi is yours.

00:19:15.780 --> 00:19:17.260
No, she was my friend.

00:19:18.620 --> 00:19:20.260
But she left.

00:19:21.120 --> 00:19:22.760
I'm sorry, Ran.

00:19:23.200 --> 00:19:25.760
I wasn't able to rise with you...

00:19:25.760 --> 00:19:27.400
Sorry for ending our dream.

00:19:28.780 --> 00:19:32.020
I'll always be cheering for you. 
We'll be friends forever.

00:19:33.440 --> 00:19:34.980
Yeah...

00:19:46.580 --> 00:19:51.000
The way Mako cried back then has been bothering me ever since.

00:19:51.000 --> 00:19:54.820
I always told myself that there was nothing I could've done about it.

00:19:54.820 --> 00:19:58.800
The reason that I step with my left leg first was because Mako used to.

00:19:59.420 --> 00:20:02.800
It's because I always used to walk alongside Mako.

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:04.300
But...

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.820
You stepped forward with a different foot than I did.

00:20:08.740 --> 00:20:11.300
But even so, our feelings remained in sync.

00:20:11.300 --> 00:20:15.320
Even if what we do is different, it doesn't mean that we can't feel the same.

00:20:19.220 --> 00:20:23.360
Let's both keep at it, Ran, and walk down our own paths.

00:20:26.540 --> 00:20:28.140
Good work, see you.

00:20:28.140 --> 00:20:29.110
Ran-san!

00:20:29.940 --> 00:20:33.540
Thank you! It's thanks to you that we were able to pass.

00:20:33.540 --> 00:20:35.580
You shared all of your feelings with me.

00:20:35.900 --> 00:20:38.800
All I did was state the obvious.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:41.340
You were the one who took flight from the runway.

00:20:48.280 --> 00:20:51.850
Aoi! I'm really sorry about making you late the other day!

00:20:51.850 --> 00:20:53.350
Huh?

00:20:53.880 --> 00:20:57.380
I shouldn't have let you follow along with my mistake.

00:20:57.380 --> 00:21:00.700
I don't want to drag down my precious friend.

00:21:00.700 --> 00:21:05.100
Then how about from now on, we don't have to be together all the time, as long as we are in spirit.

00:21:05.100 --> 00:21:05.880
Yeah!

00:21:08.340 --> 00:21:09.380
Ran-san!

00:21:09.380 --> 00:21:11.870
Oh no! She saw my adolescent indiscretions!

00:21:11.870 --> 00:21:13.370
That was great!

00:21:13.370 --> 00:21:14.780
She smiled?

00:21:14.780 --> 00:21:17.740
The Beautiful Blade that became famous for not smiling?

00:21:18.280 --> 00:21:20.280
I should've taken a picture!

00:21:20.280 --> 00:21:21.660
You with the paparazzi?!

00:21:21.660 --> 00:21:25.380
She retorted! I can't believe the Beautiful Blade retorted that!

00:21:25.380 --> 00:21:27.100
Is that impressive?

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:28.390
It's unbelievable!

00:21:28.390 --> 00:21:30.780
What kind of personality do you think I have?

00:21:30.780 --> 00:21:33.770
That's obviously the ultra sexy Japan beauty!

00:21:33.770 --> 00:21:35.770
The never smiling goddess, Beautiful Blade!

00:21:37.200 --> 00:21:38.020
As if!

00:21:38.020 --> 00:21:40.860
Her honest face is so cute.

00:21:40.860 --> 00:21:43.100
Yeah, she really is cute!

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:45.500
Don't say cute!

00:21:45.500 --> 00:21:48.240
And anyway, I've been meaning to say this,

00:21:48.240 --> 00:21:52.790
but stop calling me Ran-san! We're the same age, so I'm not your senior!

00:21:52.790 --> 00:21:54.210
So cute!

00:21:54.210 --> 00:21:56.540
Then from now on, I'll call you Ran-chan!

00:21:56.540 --> 00:21:58.480
Ran...chan?

00:22:00.000 --> 00:22:01.880
Don't say -chan either!

00:22:01.880 --> 00:22:03.920
Well then, how about Ran...

00:22:03.920 --> 00:22:04.840
Ran...

00:22:04.840 --> 00:22:05.800
Rantarou?

00:22:05.800 --> 00:22:07.300
"Rantarou"?!

00:22:08.180 --> 00:22:09.940
Ichigo, what are you saying?

00:22:09.940 --> 00:22:12.540
Ehh? But isn't it it cool like a samurai's name?

00:22:12.540 --> 00:22:15.000
Rather than a samurai, isn't it more like a ninja?

00:22:15.000 --> 00:22:16.800
Anyway, just forget about that!

00:23:55.840 --> 00:23:57.870
Ah! Aoi, what should I do?!

00:23:57.870 --> 00:23:59.580
What's wrong, Ichigo?

00:23:59.580 --> 00:24:03.700
I... I... even though I'm an idol, I don't have a signature!

00:24:03.700 --> 00:24:05.320
Next time on Aikatsu!

00:24:05.320 --> 00:24:07.050
Lost in an Autograph!

00:24:07.050 --> 00:24:10.280
Always passionate, Idol Activities!

00:24:11.170 --> 00:24:13.090
This week's Aikatsu Aphorism!

00:24:14.170 --> 00:24:16.270
Does Ran-chan's name stand for runway?

00:24:16.270 --> 00:24:18.410
It doesn't, and stop adding -chan!

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:19.550
Anyway, the aphorism!

00:24:20.310 --> 00:24:22.250
The runway is everyone's take-off point!

00:24:22.250 --> 00:24:23.550
Isn't that right, Ran-chan?

00:24:23.550 --> 00:24:25.190
I told you, stop calling me that!
